msgid "Are you sure you want to delete all the Port to MAC to IP results from the system?"
msgstr "O doro gị anya na ị chọrọ ihichapụ nsonaazụ Port ruo MAC ruo IP nile na sistemụ ahụ?"

#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Are you sure you want to delete the expired Port to MAC to IP results now?"
msgstr "O doro gị anya na ị chọrọ ihichapụ nsonaazụ Port ruo MAC ruo IP kubiri oge ugbu a?"

#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Are you sure you want to purge the cached Mactrack scanning functions?"
msgstr "Ị ji n'aka na ị chọrọ ikpochapụ ọrụ nyocha Mactrack echekwara n'ebe nchekwa nwa oge?"

#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Are you sure you want to delete all the Aggregated Port to MAC to IP results from the system?"
msgstr "O doro gị anya na ị chọrọ ihichapụ nsonaazụ Port ruo MAC ruo IP Achịkọtara nile na sistemụ ahụ?"

#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Are you sure you want to delete and recreate all the Aggregated Port to MAC to IP results from the system?"
msgstr "O doro gị anya na ị chọrọ ihichapụ ma megharịa nsonaazụ Port ruo MAC ruo IP Achịkọtara nile na sistemụ ahụ?"

#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Are you sure you want to download and import the IEEE Vendor MAC/OUI database now?"
msgstr "O doro gị anya na ị chọrọ ibudata ma bubata nchekwa data IEEE Vendor MAC/OUI ugbu a?"

#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Are you sure you want to rebuild the scan date list from the stored Port to MAC to IP results now?"
msgstr "Ị ji n'aka na ị chọrọ iwughachi ndepụta ụbọchị nyocha site na nsonaazụ Port gaa na MAC gaa na IP echekwara ugbu a?"

#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Rebuild and analyze the partition containing the latest port observation, which is the current week with weekly partitions. An unpartitioned table is optimized in full. Scheduled scans are skipped while this runs. Continue?"
msgstr "Wughachi ma nyochaa nkebi nke nwere nlele ọdụ ụgbọ njikọ kacha ọhụrụ, nke bụ izu ugbu a n'ime nkebi izu ụka. A na-emezi tebụl na-enweghị nkebi n'uju. A ga-amafe nyocha ndị edobere n'oge a na-aga. Gaa n'ihu?"

#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Run this maintenance off hours. The rebuild copies the full history of the port (MAC address), IP address and 802.1x tables one after the other and can take hours. Scheduled scans are skipped, database maintenance waits, and MAC, IP and 802.1x searching shows a maintenance message until it finishes. Allow free disk space for a second copy of each table and its indexes. Continue?"
msgstr "Gbaa mmezi a na mpụga oge ọrụ. Nrụgharị ahụ na-edegharị akụkọ ihe mere eme zuru ezu nke tebụl port (adreesị MAC), adreesị IP na 802.1x otu n'otu ma nwee ike iwere ọtụtụ awa. A na-amafe nyocha a haziri ahazi, mmezi nchekwa data na-echere, ma nchọta MAC, IP na 802.1x na-egosi ozi mmezi ruo mgbe ọ gwụchara. Hapụ ohere diski efu maka mbipụta nke abụọ nke tebụl nke ọ bụla na ndeksi ya. Gaa n'ihu?"

